5771-25/39031495_582094936911306_6800017255329826407_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j3utBQ7y-d4Q7kNvwEGjInL&_nc_oc=AdqNSxqD2ib8JjEua6yrYMzvgvhxEqdeOiVU0XtYbolhTr_r9myn6xpYn-lTcUXAuRI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT5NiX1NzMy4UsBw6CoaxuqnjeKIqL35lJo6ldU9n0cOQ&oe=6AFB3FE3"}, "display_name": "Archery Land", "keywords": [], "long_description": "You became a warrior who was called by the goddess to protect the shrine of water. \nAs evening approaches, monsters aiming for the Shrine of Water appear.\n\nWarrior! \n\nPass 6 ordeals to protect the shrine of water from monsters.  And become a legendary warrior who protects the shrine of water and protects the goddess by killing monsters! \n\nAlso, Be the greatest warrior in a breathtaking 1v1 battle with other warriors in the arena of Archery Land.", "short_description": "Archery Land is a single, multiplayer VR shooting game, and Enjoy the thrilling feeling of hitting the target in our Archery Land by aiming the bow at the wide land.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover-MiniLandscape.png", "id": "1094889764444935", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974655_1094889767778268_3491009783949024005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DB8yFEVhM4QQ7kNvwFzeFqH&_nc_oc=AdovsXgEm6bAeEeIS58_4TJ2ZixkwM94ghMtc7-OsKTM-xdWuYKCAj1TFDBBRfvw5Wk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQL3gqv9oULH7piI2pOJqv8ZU1dZgAy0rVlMeJFUQC_sQ&oe=6AFB3C81"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1038643100096859", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974716_1038643103430192_688937563710773948_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jj315hlghZgQ7kNvwEAM5Tm&_nc_oc=AdoZ-DKWJl84M7I4x9JOeDpxpgAYwC60Dj0X_m6D-8Pm-G8X7Am3YEPA0pDHFN4cRJQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht